    "description": "Gets site network device credential sync/provisioning summary. Use for credential provision summary, credential provisioning status, device credential sync status, network devices credentials sync status, and CLI/SNMP credential sync summary.\n\n**MANDATORY PREREQUISITE:** If the user gives a site name, call `api_getSites` first and use the site UUID as `id`.\n\n**Returns:** Per-type sync status and device counts for `cli`, `snmpV2Read`, `snmpV2Write`, and `snmpV3`.",
    "name": "api_getNetworkDevicesCredentialsSyncStatus",
    "parameters": {
      "properties": {
